## What We Are Building

SandyStudio = AI animation studio. This session had two threads:

1. **Hygiene** of the messy `claude/e13-thin-agent-run` working tree (leftover WIP, junk, ~50 diag scripts).
2. **The real work:** Polina (concierge EXEC-CONC) in auto mode kept hitting the "предохранитель цикла
   (6 раундов)" backstop and stalling mid-task in a live run. Director asked to fix the fuses ("они видно
   для чего-то создавались, но работают явно неправильно"). Root cause turned out to be a **structural
   door asymmetry**: the shotId normalizer `resolveShotId` (`webapp/lib/api/shot-id.ts:51`) was applied
   only at the `/trigger` route, but three other direct doors compared the RAW `body.shotId` with strict
   `!==` and rejected the bare `SH18` form — which the tool schema + system prompt tell Polina IS enough.
   Each format miss = a fresh LLM round; the SPIN guard scored the corrected arg as "progress"; 6 idle
   misses drained the fuse and cut her off with a useless "6 раундов" message.

Late in the session we discovered a **second live session (E17 run) was writing into the SAME working
tree**, which detached our HEAD and reverted `.gitignore` on disk — a two-session-one-worktree race.

