## What WORKED (with evidence)

- **Hygiene commit `12e2a81`** (on `claude/e13`) — confirmed: `git status` clean of junk after; `.gitignore`
  gained tsbuildinfo/env-bak/log/patch/media_cache/diag-script patterns; `tsconfig.tsbuildinfo` untracked.
- **3-agent parallel Explore diagnosis** — confirmed the fuse = `AUTO_REACT_ROUND_BACKSTOP`
  (`auto-react-loop.ts:23-26`, default 6), counts every LLM round, blind to mechanical retries; and the
  door asymmetry (`/trigger` resolves, `regenerate-image-from-plan:118` does not). File:line cited.
- **Loop-fuse fix — 2 commits on `teo/loop-fuse-fix`, pushed to origin** — confirmed: `npx tsc --noEmit`
  EXIT 0; `npm test -- --run` = **1145/1145 passed** (105 files); `resolveShotId` already fully unit-tested
  in `__tests__/lib/api/shot-id.test.ts`.
  - `b4cdb05 fix(shot-id)` — `resolveShotId(body.shotId, ep.episode_code)` at the head of all 3 doors:
    `regenerate-image-from-plan/route.ts` (the one Polina hit), `vgen/generate-single-shot/route.ts`,
    `shot-exclusion/route.ts` (+ added `episode_code` to its `select`).
  - `cd1cabc feat(concierge)` — `chat-internal/route.ts`: capture `lastToolError`, surface it in the
    backstop escalation ("Последний сбой инструмента: „…"") + stamp `last_tool_error` metadata. Counter/
    SPIN guard untouched.
- **Fixes are safe on remote** — confirmed: `git push -u origin teo/loop-fuse-fix` → new branch created.
- **E17 handover written** — `.claude/e17-handover-from-loop-fuse.md` with full git state + return steps.

