## Decisions Made

- **Fix by normalization at every door, NOT by touching the counter (q4=a)** — reuse existing `resolveShotId`
  at each of the 3 doors + make the escalation diagnostic. Rejected: passing `/trigger` for all doors (big
  refactor) and the deep "don't burn backstop on fail-rounds" (risks masking a real stall).
- **Hygiene q2/q3 self-done** (gitignore junk + diag scripts) — reversible, Director approved.
- **Did NOT force-push master; did NOT touch E17's working tree** — pinned fixes on `teo/loop-fuse-fix`,
  pushed to origin, and handed off. Safest path in a shared worktree.
- **`git branch teo/loop-fuse-fix cd1cabc`** to protect the 2 detached-HEAD commits from loss.

